  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Fis 1100) #8183, eff 9-28-04 (formerly Fis 1201.04); amd by #9543, eff 9-12-09; amd by #9800-A, eff 1-1-11, para (a) and (d); amd by #9800-B, eff 1-1-11, paras (b) and (c); ss by #10936, eff 1-1-16; amd by #10981, eff 1-1-16, paras (a)(2) and (d); ss by #12785, eff 5-22-19; ss by #13874, eff 2-23-24",
